{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9b83bb4a-80a2-8e09-a968-fb790a5f676a",
  "created_at": "2026-03-10T11:13:02-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Tony Lombardozzi",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:11:23-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:11:25-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi, Denise. Tony Lombardozzi. I'm calling about a dip in the road in front of my shop, 81 Marsh Street, down the Point, right across from where the old laundromat used to be."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:11:36-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a dip. Is it a pothole or more of a sunken area?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:11:41-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sunken. They dug a trench for a utility line back in the fall, patched it, and now it's settled. After the rain that ended Saturday, three days ago, it's holding water and it's deeper than it was. Cars are bottoming out on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:11:54-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, those patches love to sink. Have you reported it before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:11:58-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I mentioned it to a guy once in the fall, and nothing. So here I am again. It keeps getting worse and nobody's come to look at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:12:07-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry about that. I'll put in a work order now. Do you have photos by any chance?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:12:13-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I've got a bunch on my phone. Different angles, with a tape measure in one of them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:12:19-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. I'll give you an email to send them to in a moment. Let me get a callback number first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:12:26-04:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0186."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:12:27-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0186. Marsh Street, number 81, sunken utility patch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:12:31-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. So how long does something like this usually take? Because we've got an inspection here at the shop Thursday, and people are going to be pulling in off that street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:12:41-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Patch repairs can be a few days to a couple of weeks, depending on the crew's list and whether the utility has to come back and redo their part. I'll mark it that you have an inspection this week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:12:53-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'd appreciate anything you can do. It's been long enough."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:12:57-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Someone will call you back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:13:00-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, thanks, Denise."
    }
  ],
